    "text": "Bun Society has become a new local favourite, in my opinion the best burger currently in Kottbusser Tor area (or veggie burger at least). If you're looking for something rich and spicy, try the Bangkok Burger and the veggie patty replacement is excellent. Fries are perfectly thin and crispy, and they give a generous serving size.\n\nHopefully in the future they'll add a vegetarian option for their chicken burgers and I'd also love to see gf buns on offer.",
